BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (  # The River of Abundance) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  In the time before memory, the Sky Weaver discovered two villages separated by a mystical rive) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    r. Each dawn, she gifted the upstream village five silver seeds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  The villagers learned that any seeds cast into the river would multiply threefold by the time ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    they reached the downstream village. But the current flowed only one way - to give was to lo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    se control.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  At first, the upstream village hoarded their seeds, trusting no one. Both villages starved.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  Then a brave elder cast all five seeds into the waters. They became fifteen by journey's end. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    The downstream village, moved by such faith, returned ten seeds upstream through the mountai) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    n path. Both villages feasted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  Word spread of this miracle. The next dawn, the upstream village sent four seeds. Twelve arriv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    ed below. Eight returned. Prosperity grew.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  Some days they sent much, other days less. Sometimes returns were generous, sometimes modest. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    But the river continued to flow, and both villages learned its wisdom: abundance multiplies ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    only through the courage to release, and trust renews only through the grace to return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  The Sky Weaver smiled, for her children had learned that wealth grows not from grasping, but f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (    rom the eternal dance of giving and receiving.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (Reasoning:) Tj ET
