BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  # The Tale of the River and the Rain) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  In the time before time, there lived two spirits: Rain, who dwelled in the clouds, and River, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    who flowed through the valleys below.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  Each dawn, Rain received five drops of silver dew from the Morning Star. Rain faced a choice: ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    hold the drops safe in the clouds, or release them to River below. When Rain's drops fell, t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    hey passed through the sacred Air, which blessed them threefold, turning five drops into fif) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    teen.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (  River received this abundance and chose how much to send back as mist, nourishing Rain for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (     next day's cycle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  At first, Rain held tight to the silver drops, fearing loss. River received nothing and could ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    return nothing. Both remained unchanged, locked in stillness.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  But one dawn, Rain released all five drops in faith. River received fifteen drops and, underst) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (    anding the gift, sent back seven as mist. Both flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (  Over countless cycles, they learned the sacred rhythm: Rain gave generously, knowing the Air w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    ould multiply the gift. River returned fairly, honoring the trust. Neither sought to hoard a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    ll, nor give nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  This is how the world stays green-through the eternal dance of giving, multiplication, and ret) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    urn.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  *Trust creates abundance where caution creates drought.*) Tj ET
