BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (  The Springs were separated by a great stone, but a small channel connected them. When Silver s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (    ent water through the channel, it multiplied threefold by the time it reached Gold. Gold cou) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    ld then choose whether to send water back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
