BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    ded all five drops, and both springs remained small, their power dormant.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (  But one day, Silver trusted. She sent three drops through the channel. They multiplied to nine) Tj ET
