BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (    ow had eight drops total-more than she started with-and Gold kept three.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (  The next day, Silver sent even more gladly, and Gold returned even more generously. The spring) Tj ET
