BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  In the time before memory, two villages stood on opposite banks of the Sacred River. The River) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (     Spirit appeared to the upstream village each moon, offering five silver fish. The villagers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (     faced a choice: consume the fish themselves, or cast them into the waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  When fish entered the River, a transformation occurred-each became three, swimming downstream ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    to the lower village. Those who received multiplied fish faced their own choice: keep all fo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    r themselves, or return some upstream as gratitude.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  At first, fear ruled both banks. The upstream village hoarded their fish, sending nothing. The) Tj ET
