BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  One brave soul sent three fish downstream. Six returned to their village. Others witnessed thi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    s wisdom. Soon, currents flowed both ways-gifts descending, gratitude ascending.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  The River Spirit smiled. "You have learned: trust creates abundance that none can achieve alon) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    e. The current connects you. What flows freely, returns threefold.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (  Thus, both villages prospered, understanding that true wealth lies not in hoarding, but in the) Tj ET
