BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (  In the time before time, two villages stood on opposite banks of a river. The Northern village) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (     received water from mountain springs, while the Southern village faced drought.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (  The River Keeper appeared to the North and said, "Share your water, and the river will triple ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (    what flows across." ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (  The Northerners hesitated-what if the South kept everything? ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  One brave soul, Aster, poured half their spring water into the river. It swirled and multiplie) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    d, reaching the Southern shore as a great flood of plenty. The Southerners rejoiced and deba) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    ted: should they keep this gift entirely?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  An elder spoke: "The river multiplied what was shared with trust. To break that trust is to po) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    ison the very source." ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (  They sent back half of what they received, enough that Aster now had more than when they start) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    ed, and the South had abundance too.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  Word spread between the villages. Others began sharing, and each time both sides prospered. Th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    ose who gave generously received generously. Those who hoarded found the river would dry up ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    for them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  Thus the River taught: Trust multiplies what is shared, but only reciprocity sustains the flow) Tj ET
