BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      The goddess Reciproka appeared to the villages and declared: "Each day, one village may po) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (        ur water into the River of Giving. The sacred stones will triple its flow, and it will r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        each another village downstream. That village must then decide what portion to send back) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (         through the River of Return.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      The first village, fearful, sent nothing. They remained thirsty, as did their downstream n) Tj ET
