BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      # The Myth of the River's Gift) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      In the time before memory, two villages stood on opposite banks of the Sacred River. The R) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        iver Spirit appeared to the upstream village each moon, offering five silver fish. The v) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        illagers faced a choice: consume the fish themselves, or cast them into the waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      When fish entered the River, a transformation occurred-each became three, swimming downstr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        eam to the lower village. Those who received multiplied fish faced their own choice: kee) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        p all for themselves, or return some upstream as gratitude.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      At first, fear ruled both banks. The upstream village hoarded their fish, sending nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (         The downstream village grew resentful. Hunger haunted both shores.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      Then came the Wise Woman, Cyra, who spoke: "The River teaches balance. Those who give noth) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        ing, receive nothing. But generosity multiplied returns as blessing.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      One brave soul sent three fish downstream. Six returned to their village. Others witnessed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (         this wisdom. Soon, currents flowed both ways-gifts descending, gratitude ascending.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      The River Spirit smiled. "You have learned: trust creates abundance that none can achieve ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        alone. The current connects you. What flows freely, returns threefold.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      Thus, both villages prospered, understanding that true wealth lies not in hoarding, but in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (         the sacred cycle of giving and returning.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (    reasoning:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      The user wants me to write a 200-word myth that reflects how the trust game should be play) Tj ET
