BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    # The River of Abundance) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    In the time before memory, the Sky Weaver discovered two villages separated by a mystical ri) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      ver. Each dawn, she gifted the upstream village five silver seeds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    The villagers learned that any seeds cast into the river would multiply threefold by the tim) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      e they reached the downstream village. But the current flowed only one way - to give was t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      o lose control.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    At first, the upstream village hoarded their seeds, trusting no one. Both villages starved.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    Then a brave elder cast all five seeds into the waters. They became fifteen by journey's end) Tj ET
