BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    In the beginning, two springs emerged from the mountain: the Spring of Silver and the Spring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (       of Gold. Each day, the Spring of Silver received five drops of sacred water from the heav) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    The Springs were separated by a great stone, but a small channel connected them. When Silver) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (       sent water through the channel, it multiplied threefold by the time it reached Gold. Gold) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (       could then choose whether to send water back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
