BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      In the time before memory, the Sky Weaver discovered two villages separated by a mystical ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        river. Each dawn, she gifted the upstream village five silver seeds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      The villagers learned that any seeds cast into the river would multiply threefold by the t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        ime they reached the downstream village. But the current flowed only one way - to give w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        as to lose control.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      At first, the upstream village hoarded their seeds, trusting no one. Both villages starved) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        .) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      Then a brave elder cast all five seeds into the waters. They became fifteen by journey's e) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        nd. The downstream village, moved by such faith, returned ten seeds upstream through the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (         mountain path. Both villages feasted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      Word spread of this miracle. The next dawn, the upstream village sent four seeds. Twelve a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        rrived below. Eight returned. Prosperity grew.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      Some days they sent much, other days less. Sometimes returns were generous, sometimes mode) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        st. But the river continued to flow, and both villages learned its wisdom: abundance mul) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (        tiplies only through the courage to release, and trust renews only through the grace to ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (        return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      The Sky Weaver smiled, for her children had learned that wealth grows not from grasping, b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (        ut from the eternal dance of giving and receiving.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
