BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      # The Tale of the River of Abundance) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      In the time before time, two villages stood on opposite banks of a river. The Northern vil) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (        lage received water from mountain springs, while the Southern village faced drought.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      The River Keeper appeared to the North and said, "Share your water, and the river will tri) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        ple what flows across." ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      The Northerners hesitated-what if the South kept everything? ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      One brave soul, Aster, poured half their spring water into the river. It swirled and multi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        plied, reaching the Southern shore as a great flood of plenty. The Southerners rejoiced ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        and debated: should they keep this gift entirely?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      An elder spoke: "The river multiplied what was shared with trust. To break that trust is t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        o poison the very source." ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      They sent back half of what they received, enough that Aster now had more than when they s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        tarted, and the South had abundance too.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      Word spread between the villages. Others began sharing, and each time both sides prospered) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        . Those who gave generously received generously. Those who hoarded found the river would) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (         dry up for them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
