BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        bundance that flowed to the Guardian of Return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      At first, the Guardian of Risk feared loss and poured nothing. The valley remained barren,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (         and both spirits went thirsty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      But one morning, remembering the wisdom of the ancient oracle-"That which flows returns"-s) Tj ET
