BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      # The Tale of the River and the Rain) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      In the time before time, there lived two spirits: Rain, who dwelled in the clouds, and Riv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (        er, who flowed through the valleys below.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      Each dawn, Rain received five drops of silver dew from the Morning Star. Rain faced a choi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (        ce: hold the drops safe in the clouds, or release them to River below. When Rain's drops) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (         fell, they passed through the sacred Air, which blessed them threefold, turning five dr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (        ops into fifteen.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      River received this abundance and chose how much to send back as mist, nourishing Rain for) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (         the next day's cycle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      At first, Rain held tight to the silver drops, fearing loss. River received nothing and co) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (        uld return nothing. Both remained unchanged, locked in stillness.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      But one dawn, Rain released all five drops in faith. River received fifteen drops and, und) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (        erstanding the gift, sent back seven as mist. Both flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      Over countless cycles, they learned the sacred rhythm: Rain gave generously, knowing the A) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (        ir would multiply the gift. River returned fairly, honoring the trust. Neither sought to) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (         hoard all, nor give nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      This is how the world stays green-through the eternal dance of giving, multiplication, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (         return.) Tj ET
