BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      In the beginning, two springs emerged from the mountain: the Spring of Silver and the Spri) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        ng of Gold. Each day, the Spring of Silver received five drops of sacred water from the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        heavens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      The Springs were separated by a great stone, but a small channel connected them. When Silv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        er sent water through the channel, it multiplied threefold by the time it reached Gold. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        Gold could then choose whether to send water back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      At first, Silver feared. "If I send my water, I may receive nothing in return." So Silver ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        hoarded all five drops, and both springs remained small, their power dormant.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      But one day, Silver trusted. She sent three drops through the channel. They multiplied to ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        nine drops in Gold's basin. Gold, grateful for this gift, returned six drops to Silver. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        Silver now had eight drops total-more than she started with-and Gold kept three.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      The next day, Silver sent even more gladly, and Gold returned even more generously. The sp) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        rings grew into flowing rivers, their abundance filling the valley below.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      The elders say: Trust creates the channel. Reciprocity multiplies the gift. When both give) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (         freely, both receive abundantly. Hoarding brings stagnation; sharing brings prosperity ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        to all.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (    reasoning:) Tj ET
