BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      # The Tale of the Two Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      In the beginning, the goddess of Fortune blessed the valleys with two rivers. Each dawn, t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (        he River of Giving flowed with five silver coins, while the River of Receiving lay empty) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (        , waiting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      The first people who came to the rivers were afraid. "If I pour my coins into the other ri) Tj ET
