BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      # The Tale of the Two Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      In the age before memory, two rivers flowed through a parched valley-the River of Risk and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (         the River of Return. Each was tended by a guardian spirit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      The Guardian of Risk possessed five sacred vessels of water each dawn. When she poured her) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (         vessels into the valley between the rivers, the waters multiplied threefold, creating a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        bundance that flowed to the Guardian of Return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      At first, the Guardian of Risk feared loss and poured nothing. The valley remained barren,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (         and both spirits went thirsty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      But one morning, remembering the wisdom of the ancient oracle-"That which flows returns"-s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        he poured all five vessels. The waters swelled to fifteen, reaching the Guardian of Retu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        rn in a magnificent flood.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      The Guardian of Return, witnessing this courage, understood the sacred balance. She return) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        ed half the abundance, sending wealth back upstream while keeping prosperity for herself) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        .) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      From that day forward, the pattern held: generous pouring created multiplication, and fair) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (         returning sustained the cycle. The valley bloomed eternal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      The elders say: Trust is the vessel, courage is the pouring, and reciprocity is the spring) Tj ET
