BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      Both now had more than they started with.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      The goddess smiled. "You have discovered the secret," she said. "Trust creates abundance w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        here fear creates scarcity. When one gives and the other returns fairly, the valley pros) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        pers. But when either hoards or betrays, the magic dies, and both rivers run dry.") Tj ET
