BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      Briar, a spring nestled among wild roses, first met Elara, who flowed from moonlit caves. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (        Elara showed great courage, releasing four of her five drops. The Air transformed them i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        nto twelve, which Briar received with wonder. Remembering the old ways, Briar sent back ) Tj ET
