BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      In the time before memory, two villages stood on opposite banks of the Sacred River. The R) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (        iver Spirit appeared to the upstream village each moon, offering five silver fish. The v) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (        illagers faced a choice: consume the fish themselves, or cast them into the waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      When fish entered the River, a transformation occurred-each became three, swimming downstr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (        eam to the lower village. Those who received multiplied fish faced their own choice: kee) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (        p all for themselves, or return some upstream as gratitude.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      At first, fear ruled both banks. The upstream village hoarded their fish, sending nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (         The downstream village grew resentful. Hunger haunted both shores.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      Then came the Wise Woman, Cyra, who spoke: "The River teaches balance. Those who give noth) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        ing, receive nothing. But generosity multiplied returns as blessing.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      One brave soul sent three fish downstream. Six returned to their village. Others witnessed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (         this wisdom. Soon, currents flowed both ways-gifts descending, gratitude ascending.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      The River Spirit smiled. "You have learned: trust creates abundance that none can achieve ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        alone. The current connects you. What flows freely, returns threefold.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      Thus, both villages prospered, understanding that true wealth lies not in hoarding, but in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (         the sacred cycle of giving and returning.) Tj ET
