BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      One by one, the eight Guardians embraced this wisdom. Dawn, Twilight, Noon, Finn, Galen, C) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (        yra, and the others-each learning from what they witnessed and experienced.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      The goddess Reciproka watched with pride as the valley found its equilibrium. "You have di) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (        scovered the Golden Standard," she proclaimed. "Not fifty-fifty division, but tenfold re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (        turn-a sacred ratio that honors both the sender's complete faith and the receiver's abun) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (        dance. When all Guardians uphold this standard, trust becomes unshakeable, and the magic) Tj ET
