BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      Aster watched the waters and saw echoes of other exchanges. Briar had walked this path wit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (        h Elara, sending four coins twice and returning seven when twelve arrived. The pattern w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        as clear: Briar understood the rhythm of generous giving and fair return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      "The River connects us all," Aster realized. "Though we stand at different shores, we drin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (        k from the same source. Briar has proven trustworthy with another; that proof travels do) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        wnstream to me.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      Aster sent four coins-the same gift that had served well with Dorian. They multiplied to t) Tj ET
