BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      The ancient waters whispered their wisdom: "Trust is not bound to single partnerships. Whe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        n you prove fair with one keeper, all keepers see. When you honor the gift you receive, ) Tj ET
