BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        might do.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      Thus the valley learned: consistency builds reputation, reputation builds trust, and trust) Tj ET
