BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        turned ten. That act of faith created something greater than fairness-it created abundan) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        ce for both.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
