BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      Now the fifth dawn brought Cyra, keeper of calibrated wisdom.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      Cyra had walked with Finn, returning ten from fifteen for complete trust. With Briar, she ) Tj ET
